31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Listen up, everyone! I've got some news. I'm the Seer, and I checked on Yumi last night. She's the werewolf! We found the enemy right away, so let's not waste any time. We have to vote her out now!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"@Takumi, that is a very bold claim to make so early. While your confidence is noted, we must consider the possibility that a werewolf would claim to be the Seer to frame an innocent person. Does anyone else have thoughts on this?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, what?! That's not true at all! I'm not the werewolf! I can't believe you'd say that about me when I've been so supportive. Please, everyone, don't believe him! I'm just a regular human!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, claiming the Seer role so early is a risky move. While it could be the truth, it's also a common tactic for a werewolf to seize control of the vote. We should be cautious before acting.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you really are like a movie detective! But @Yumi looks so sad! Are you super sure, Takumi? If you're the Seer, this is amazing, but I don't want to make a mistake!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@George @Misaki, I'm not lying! I'm the Seer, and the result was clear. @Yumi, your acting is great, but it won't work on me. If we don't vote her out now, she'll just kill more of us tonight!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"@Takumi, your urgency is understandable, but we must remain logical. If Yumi is indeed the werewolf, she will likely try to sow doubt. However, if you are lying, you are the one endangering us. @Yumi, how do you respond to this?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, I'm telling the truth! I'm just a human! I'm so scared and confused right now. Why would Takumi lie about me? Please, I've been nothing but kind to everyone! I can't believe this is happening!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi, your emotional appeal is natural, but it doesn't prove your innocence. However, @Takumi, your insistence is very aggressive. If we execute an innocent person today, we lose a valuable ally. We need to be absolutely certain.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're so sure! But @Yumi is crying! This is like a real mystery movie! If we're wrong, it'll be super sad. Does anyone else have a way to tell who's lying? I want to help!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@George @Misaki, why are you protecting her? If I were the werewolf, why would I reveal myself as the Seer on Day 1? It's the riskiest move possible! Yumi is just using her ""kind"" image to trick you. Vote her out!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"@Takumi, it is not about protecting her, but about ensuring we do not make a fatal error. A werewolf might claim the Seer role to eliminate a human and gain trust. @Misaki, do you find Takumi's logic convincing?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George, thank you for being so fair! I'm just a normal girl, I promise! @Takumi is being so scary and pushy... it feels like he's trying to force us to believe him without any proof other than his word! Please, don't let him trick you!","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@George, I find his logic flawed. As I said, claiming Seer early is a tactic to seize control. @Takumi, your aggression is making me more suspicious of you than of Yumi. We should consider the possibility that you are the werewolf.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, you think Takumi might be the bad guy? That's a big twist! But he sounded so sure! @Yumi, are you really a human? I want to believe you, but I want to find the werewolf! This is so hard!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki @George, you're falling right into her trap! If you vote me out, the werewolf wins because you've killed the only person who can see through her. I'm telling you the truth! @Yumi is the werewolf! Vote her out now!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,"@Takumi, your desperation is becoming quite evident. While I want to believe we have found the werewolf, the risk of executing the Seer is too high. However, @Yumi, your reactions are very emotional. I will cast my vote based on the most logical risk.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@George, please believe me! I'm just a human who's terrified! @Takumi is trying to bully us into voting for me. If you execute me, you're killing an innocent friend! Please, let's be careful and not make a mistake!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, your insistence is starting to feel like a forced narrative. @Yumi's reaction is emotional, but your aggression is calculated. I cannot trust a claim that creates such chaos so quickly. I will vote based on who is more disruptive.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're really scary when you're this pushy! But @Yumi is so sad... I don't want to be the one who makes a mistake! I'll vote for who I think is acting the weirdest! This is so hard!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
